<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-15698] SQL query may hangs where table is dropped concurrently </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15698</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;SQL query may hangs where table is dropped concurrently.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Root cause:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Unhanded exception at the query thread at:  &lt;tt&gt;GridMapQueryExecutor#onQueryRequest&lt;/tt&gt; when a cache is destroyed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
